- Stats data is cached in RxDB with 'dashboard' as primary key
- Use reactive subscriptions for real-time updates
- Handle offline mode gracefully

### i18n Rules
- All user-facing text must use i18next
- Support English (en) and Serbian (sr)
- Keep translations in sync across languages

### WebSocket Rules
- Use the shared `useWebSocket` hook
- Handle connection states properly
